{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11211310","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211310","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1121131001:1":{"text":"How did the investigation go?","source_cn":"各位，调查出什么结果了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8B366D8E4D16BA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121131002:0":{"text":"The statues look identical to the one missing in the Holistone plaza. In terms of appearance, there are no discernible differences between the two statues.","source_cn":"外表看起来和圣石镇广场中心丢失的那座雕像完全一致，两座...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05EFFB162EA5D89F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121131003:2":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> has confirmed that there are traces of magic on the statues... and it's similar to the Hypogean magic we sensed around Talene!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA9C75A1F4B24FE89","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> has confirmed that there are traces of magic on the statues... and it's similar to the Hypogean magic we sensed around Talene!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> has confirmed that there are traces of magic on the statues... and it's similar to the Hypogean magic we sensed around Talene!","variant_male_record_index":"99438","variant_female_record_index":"99439","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121131004:1":{"text":"Dura above! How blas